    "message": "Development on this project has ceased as .NET Core has been the recommended framework for some time. Additionally, several dependencies are no longer available, making continued maintenance difficult. However, the final version will remain available for anyone who wishes to use it. I hope it has been useful to the community!",
    "reasons": [
      "Legacy"
    ]
  },
  "description": "This package allows to store session data in MongoDB Replica Set. This data server distribution provides high availability for your web app and the possibility to distribute session data in a different servers and locations. If primary server fails, the application will still alive during the usual time needed to elect another server as a primary. For further information visit the documentation available in project URL. The source code contains several passed test cases.",
  "id": "MongoSessionStateStore",
  "isPrerelease": false,
